        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Mismo** agrees: **ella misma**, **ellos mismos**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Sí** (with accent) and **consigo** are the reflexive forms for third person and **usted / ustedes**. In everyday Mexican speech, **él mismo / con él mismo** also shows up, but **sí mismo / consigo** is the standard."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **mismo** = _-self_, and it always matches the person."
        }
      ]
